co-author alongside several University of Düsseldorf researchers."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1283, "end": 1467, "text": "Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms MacKenzie's employment, with records showing that he was a member of the university's faculty from 2015 to 2018."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1468, "end": 1536, "text": "When asked about MacKenzie's tenure at the university, Professor Dr."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1776, "text": "Jürgen Schmid, Dean of the Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences at the University of Düsseldorf, commented, \"Colin was a valued member of our academic community, and his research expertise was a significant asset to our institution."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1777, "end": 1826, "text": "We're proud to have had him as part of our team.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1827, "end": 1942, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Colin R MacKenzie did, in fact, work for the University of Düsseldorf."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1943, "end": 2101, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on MacKenzie's impressive research background and underscores the significance of his contributions to the academic community."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2102, "end": 2114, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2116, "end": 2169, "text": "* University of Düsseldorf Human Resources Department"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2170, "end": 2175, "text": "* Dr."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2176, "end": 2234, "text": "Anna-Lena Schumann, Researcher at University of Düsseldorf"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2235, "end": 2250, "text": "* Professor Dr."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2251, "end": 2349, "text": "Jürgen Schmid, Dean of the Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences at University of Düsseldorf"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2350, "end": 2365, "text": "* MacKenzie, C."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2366, "end": 2376, "text": "R., et al."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2377, "end": 2384, "text": "(2017)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2385, "end": 2430, "text": "\"Breakthrough in Materials Science Research.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "**Renowned Geologist Colin R."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 30, "end": 82, "text": "MacKenzie Reflects on Illustrious Career with USGS**"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 84, "end": 99, "text": "Washington D.C."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 100, "end": 151, "text": "- In a career spanning over three decades, Colin R."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 152, "end": 354, "text": "MacKenzie has left an indelible mark on the field of geology, and his work with the United States Geological Survey (USGS) has been instrumental in shaping our understanding of the Earth's complexities."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 355, "end": 517, "text": "MacKenzie, a soft-spoken yet fiercely passionate researcher, joined the USGS in 1990, bringing with him a wealth of knowledge and expertise in structural geology."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 518, "end": 682, "text": "Over the years, he has been an integral part of numerous high-profile projects, including the groundbreaking study on the tectonic evolution of the Rocky Mountains."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 683, "end": 839, "text": "\"I was drawn to the 